        "answer": {
          "short": "Four parallel lines: $y=\\frac12x-2$, $y=\\frac12x-1$, $y=\\frac12x+1$ and $y=\\frac12x+2$.",
          "worked": "Set $y=0$ to find each $x$-intercept and set $x=0$ to find each $y$-intercept.\n\nFor $c=-2$, plot $(4,0)$ and $(0,-2)$.\n\nFor $c=-1$, plot $(2,0)$ and $(0,-1)$.\n\nFor $c=1$, plot $(-2,0)$ and $(0,1)$.\n\nFor $c=2$, plot $(-4,0)$ and $(0,2)$.\n\nDraw each straight line through its two intercepts on the same axes.",
